<title>UK: LONDON CURRENCY AND GOLD BULLION RATES.</title>
<headline>LONDON CURRENCY AND GOLD BULLION RATES.</headline>
<text>
<p>LONDON, Reuter - Following are the buying and selling rates for leading world currencies and gold against the dollar on the London foreign exchange and bullion markets today.</p>
<p>(Tourist rates will differ from those quoted)</p>
<p>US$1.00 COSTS    1.3522/27  Canadian Dollars</p>
<p>		     1.5761/71  German Marks</p>
<p>		     1.7694/99  Dutch Guilders</p>
<p>		     1.3675/85  Swiss Francs</p>
<p>		     32.49/50   Belgian Francs</p>
<p>		     5.3174/94  French Francs</p>
<p>		     1537.0/8.0 Italian Lire</p>
<p>		     116.35/45  Japanese Yen</p>
<p>		     6.9166/16  Swedish Crowns</p>
<p>		     6.4396/11  Norwegian Crowns</p>
<p>		     6.0055/65  Danish Crowns</p>
<p>		     1.4050/60  Singapore Dollars</p>
<p>		     0.7794/99  Australian Dollars</p>
<p>		     7.7370/80  Hong Kong Dollars</p>
<p>One Sterling     US$1.6985/05</p>
<p>Gold (ounce)     US$357.20/357.70</p>
</text>
